WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:03.200
One sultan controlled market prices.

2
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.928
Another moved his capital and

3
00:00:04.928 --> 00:00:06.590
minted token coins.

4
00:00:06.917 --> 00:00:08.991
Alauddin Khalji fixed prices in

5
00:00:08.991 --> 00:00:10.443
Delhi's markets,

6
00:00:10.443 --> 00:00:11.902
and measured land to raise

7
00:00:11.902 --> 00:00:12.889
revenue.

8
00:00:13.223 --> 00:00:15.480
Muhammad bin Tughlaq shifted his

9
00:00:15.480 --> 00:00:17.314
capital to Daulatabad.

10
00:00:17.314 --> 00:00:19.043
And tried token copper coins,

11
00:00:19.043 --> 00:00:20.985
which were easily forged.

12
00:00:21.316 --> 00:00:23.854
Firoz Shah Tughlaq built canals

13
00:00:23.854 --> 00:00:25.412
and new towns.

14
00:00:25.746 --> 00:00:26.923
Your turn.

15
00:00:26.923 --> 00:00:28.751
Who moved the capital?
